url: https://a1ex092.github.io/global-lead-intelligence/
abstract: >-
  Open evidence on lead contamination in consumer products. Six public sources
  harmonised into one schema: 15,159 measurements from Pure Earth's Rapid Market
  Screening, the New York City Health Department and Public Health Seattle &
  King County; country context from WHO's lead paint law tracker and IPEN paint
  studies; and 904 recalls and alerts from the FDA, CPSC and RASFF. Every row
  keeps its source, sampling strategy, measurement operator, detection limit and
  origin confidence, so that biases remain visible rather than averaged away.
  This documents the contamination of products, not human exposure.
keywords:
  - lead poisoning
  - consumer products
